Subject: [PATCH] Add main image functionality to Product and ProductImage
 models

- Updated ProductImageInline in admin.py to include 'is_main' field for image management.
- Enhanced Product model with properties to retrieve the main image and its thumbnail.
- Modified ProductImage model to ensure only one image can be marked as main per product.
- Updated catalog and pricing_sheet templates to utilize the new main image logic and display short descriptions.
- Created a new migration to add 'is_main' field to ProductImage model.
